                        "text": "Library lint checks reference invalid APIs; these checks will be skipped!\n\nLint found an issue registry (androidx.lifecycle.lint.LifecycleRuntimeIssueRegistry)\nwhich contains some references to invalid API:\norg.jetbrains.kotlin.asJava.elements.KtLightModifierList#getKotlinOrigin(): org.jetbrains.kotlin.psi.KtModifierList\n(Referenced from androidx/lifecycle/lint/LifecycleWhenChecksKt.class)\n\nTherefore, this lint check library is not included\nin analysis. This affects the following lint checks:\nUnsafeLifecycleWhenUsage,RepeatOnLifecycleWrongUsage\n\nTo use this lint check, upgrade to a more recent version\nof the library.",
                        "markdown": "Library lint checks reference invalid APIs; these checks **will be skipped**!\n\nLint found an issue registry (`androidx.lifecycle.lint.LifecycleRuntimeIssueRegistry`)\nwhich contains some references to invalid API:\norg.jetbrains.kotlin.asJava.elements.KtLightModifierList#getKotlinOrigin(): org.jetbrains.kotlin.psi.KtModifierList\n(Referenced from androidx/lifecycle/lint/LifecycleWhenChecksKt.class)\n\nTherefore, this lint check library is **not** included\nin analysis. This affects the following lint checks:\n`UnsafeLifecycleWhenUsage`,`RepeatOnLifecycleWrongUsage`\n\nTo use this lint check, upgrade to a more recent version\nof the library."
